        "text": "e you slumber in bed, as you turn off the lights... you get to realize na andami nilang sakripisyo.\nThey are the new warriors of this war-like era where the enemy is not seen, where the enemy battles, not with warheads of hi-caliber gun machines but fights with equality targeting the weakness of health.\nKung hanggang ngayon, wala ka pang realization to change for the better, pagkatapos ng lahat ng mga nangyayari - i guess, bato nga ang puso mo, 'di lang para sa mga lumalaban na nasa ating unahan",
